		{
			dependencies: ["61A708E2863694A6"]
			description: ["You can not punch wood in Infinite Horizons Expert. You need to trade for tools that can harvest trees for you. To get some emeralds, you need to farm some crops first. You can also take advantage of the piles of hay throughout the village."]
